==Faroese==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ɔaːɹ]|lang=fo}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|ár||year|lang=non}}, from {{proto|gem-pro|jēran|lang=fo}}. Cognates include: Dutch and Afrikaans {{term|jaar|lang=nl}}, English {{term|year|lang=en}}, German {{term|Jahr|lang=de}}, Danish, Norwegian and Swedish {{term|år|lang=da}}.

====Noun====
{{head|fo|noun|g=n}} ([[árs|ár-s]], ár-)

# [[year]]

=====Declension=====
{{fo-decl-noun-n3|ár}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|ár|lang=non}}, from {{proto|gem-pro|airō|lang=fo}}. Cognates include: Old English {{term|ar|ār|oar|lang=ang}} (English {{term|oar|lang=en}}).

====Noun====
{{head|fo|noun|g=f}} ([[árar|ár-ar]], [[árar|ár-ar]])

# [[oar]]

=====Declension=====
{{fo-decl-noun-f6|ár}}

