* {{l|is|ártíð}}
* {{l|is|í ár}}
* {{l|is|gleðilegt nýtt ár}}
* {{l|is|gleðilegt ár}}
* {{l|is|hlaupaár}}
* {{l|is|áramót}}
* {{l|is|nýár}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|ár|lang=non}}, from {{proto|gem-pro|airō|lang=is}}. Cognates include: Old English {{term|ar|ār|oar|lang=ang}} (English {{term|oar|lang=en}}).<ref name="torp"/>

====Noun====
{{is-noun|f|árar|árar}}

# [[oar]]
# {{is-inflection of|ár|indef|acc|s}}
# {{is-inflection of|ár|indef|dat|s}}

=====Declension=====
